#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:221
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_ThisIsExhibitHall"
msgid "This is our special exhibit hall.$"
msgstr "这里是我们的特别展厅。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:224
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_ExplainExhibitHall"
msgid ""
"As you can plainly see, there is not\n"
"a single painting on exhibit.\p"
"Here, I don't wish to exhibit works of\n"
"so-called classical art.\p"
"Such classical works you can see on\n"
"our ground floor.\p"
"I wish to exhibit work that is far\n"
"different from the classics.\p"
"Art, after all, is not restricted to old,\n"
"famous works!\p"
"This exhibit hall, I wish to fill it with…\p"
"Modern and vibrant artworks of\n"
"POKéMON seemingly ready to spring\l"
"forth into glorious life!$"
msgstr ""
"正如你看到的，\n"
"这里一幅画都没有展出。\p"
"在这里，我不想展出\n"
"所谓的古典艺术作品。\p"
"那样的古典作品，\n"
"在我们一楼就能看到。\p"
"我想展出的，\n"
"是和古典作品截然不同的作品。\p"
"毕竟，艺术并不只限于\n"
"古老的名作！\p"
"这个展厅，我想用……\p"
"充满活力、仿佛随时会\n"
"跃然而出的宝可梦现代艺术作品\l"
"来填满它！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:240
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_PleaseObtainPaintingsForExhibit"
msgid ""
"I beg your pardon. I didn't intend\n"
"to monopolize the conversation.\p"
"Now, as you are young, and yet\n"
"obviously well traveled…\p"
"You must encounter lively POKéMON\n"
"and works of art depicting them.\p"
"If you were to come across such\n"
"a painting, may we ask you to obtain\l"
"the artist's permission to exhibit\l"
"it here?$"
msgstr ""
"不好意思。我并不是想\n"
"一个人说个不停。\p"
"对了，你虽然年轻，\n"
"但显然去过很多地方……\p"
"你一定会遇到充满活力的宝可梦，\n"
"以及描绘它们的艺术作品。\p"
"如果你遇到了那样的画作，\n"
"能请你征得画家的同意，\l"
"让我们在这里展出吗？$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:252
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_WishToFillExhibit"
msgid ""
"I wish to fill this exhibit hall with\n"
"modern and vibrant paintings of\l"
"POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"我希望用充满活力的\n"
"宝可梦现代画作\l"
"来填满这个展厅。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:257
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_ThanksAddedNewPainting"
msgid ""
"Thanks to you, we've added a new\n"
"painting to our collection!\p"
"I've heard it depicts your POKéMON.\n"
"Truly magnificent!\p"
"Thank you so very, very much!$"
msgstr ""
"多亏了你，我们的收藏中\n"
"又多了一幅新的画作！\p"
"听说画的是你的宝可梦。\n"
"真是太精彩了！\p"
"真的非常、非常感谢你！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:264
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_ItsYouPlayer"
msgid ""
"Ah! It's you!\n"
"{PLAYER}!$"
msgstr ""
"啊！是你！\n"
"{PLAYER}！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:268
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_PaintingsAttractedMoreGuests"
msgid ""
"Isn't this marvelous?\n"
"This collection of paintings!\p"
"Each one of them flawless!\n"
"None better than another!\p"
"These paintings have attracted\n"
"more guests to our ART MUSEUM.\p"
"Sincerely, I thank you, {PLAYER}.\n"
"This is my dream come true!$"
msgstr ""
"是不是很棒？\n"
"这些收藏的画作！\p"
"每一幅都完美无缺！\n"
"没有哪一幅比其他的更好！\p"
"这些画作为我们美术馆\n"
"吸引了更多的参观者。\p"
"{PLAYER}，我衷心地感谢你。\n"
"我的梦想实现了！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:278
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_TokenOfGratitude"
msgid "This is merely a token of my gratitude.$"
msgstr "这只是我的一点小小心意。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:281
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_KeepThisForYou"
msgid ""
"I will keep this for you until we\n"
"meet again.$"
msgstr ""
"在我们再次见面之前，\n"
"我先替你保管着。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:285
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_HonorToHaveYouVisit"
msgid ""
"Ah, so good to see you, {PLAYER}!\p"
"It's an honor to have you visit us\n"
"on your busy journeys.\p"
"Please, relax and do enjoy your\n"
"visit with us.$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}，见到你真高兴！\p"
"你在繁忙的旅途中还来参观，\n"
"真是我们的荣幸。\p"
"请放松心情，好好参观吧。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:292
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_ItsPinkPictureFrame"
msgid ""
"It's a picture frame with pink-colored\n"
"adornments.$"
msgstr ""
"这是一个装饰着\n"
"粉红色花纹的画框。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:296
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_ItsYellowPictureFrame"
msgid ""
"It's a picture frame with\n"
"yellow-colored adornments.$"
msgstr ""
"这是一个装饰着\n"
"黄色花纹的画框。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:300
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_ItsBluePictureFrame"
msgid ""
"It's a picture frame with\n"
"blue-colored adornments.$"
msgstr ""
"这是一个装饰着\n"
"蓝色花纹的画框。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:304
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_ItsRedPictureFrame"
msgid ""
"It's a picture frame with\n"
"red-colored adornments.$"
msgstr ""
